{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","裂风穿刺"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","질풍 추력"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","击退1名敌人并为其添加“丛林印记”。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","1명의 적을 넉백시키고 숲의 각인을 추가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，卡夫拉会优先攻击处于“丛林印记”状态的敌人，“丛林印记”最多只会存在1个。使用终极技能时，卡夫拉为一名敌人添加“丛林印记”，对其造成迅猛绝伦的一击，造成500% + 50% ATK伤害，并击退2格。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","패시브: 카프라가 숲의 각인 상태인 적을 우선 공격하며, 숲의 각인은 최대 1개만 존재한다. \n액티브: 카프라는 적 1명에게 숲의 각인을 추가하며, 해당 적에게 맹렬한 일격을 입혀 500% + 50% ATK의 대미지를 입히고 2칸 넉백시킨다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":84,"end":90,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":105,"end":111,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":80,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":101,"end":115,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至510% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 510% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至520% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 520% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至530% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 530% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至550% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 550% + 50% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","林间追猎"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","끊임없는 추격"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","冲向1名敌人，造成伤害并眩晕。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","적 1명에게 돌진하여 대미지를 입히고 스턴시킨다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当处于“丛林印记”状态的敌人脱离自己的攻击范围，卡夫拉便会向其冲锋，造成280% ATK伤害，使其眩晕1.5 + 0.5秒。如果场上不存在处于“丛林印记”状态的敌人，卡夫拉会对最近目标施加“丛林印记”，并释放本技能。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","숲의 각인 상태의 적이 자신의 공격 범위를 벗어날 때마다 카프라는 적에게 돌격하여 280% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 1.5 + 0.5초간 스턴시킨다. 전장에 숲의 각인 상태의 적이 없으면 카프라는 가장 가까운 목표에게 숲의 각인을 부여하여 해당 스킬을 시전한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":69,"end":75,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":46,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至290% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 290% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 300% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至320% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 320% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","丛林之敌"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","숲의 분노"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","降低携带“丛林印记”的敌人的护甲，并且在击败他时得到增益。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","숲의 각인을 가진 적의 물리 방어력을 감소시키고, 목표를 처치할 때 버프를 획득한다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“丛林印记”能够降低敌人6%护甲，携带“丛林印记”的敌人被击败时，这名敌人周围2格内的友军每0.375秒回复-100% − 15% ATK生命值，持续1.125秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","숲의 각인은 적의 물리 방어력을 6% 감소시킬 수 있다. 숲의 각인을 가진 적을 처치하면 해당 적 주변 2칸 내의 아군이 0.375초마다 -100% − 15% ATK의 HP를 회복하며, 1.125초간 지속된다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":59,"end":65,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":82,"end":88,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":77,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","下降护甲的幅度提升至9%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","물리 방어력 감소폭이 9%로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","下降护甲的幅度提升至12%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","물리 방어력 감소폭이 12%로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","下降护甲的幅度提升至15%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","물리 방어력 감소폭이 15%로 증가한다."],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/kr","영웅 마스터리"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신의 공격력이 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격력이 12% 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격력이 16% 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 공격력이 20% 증가한다."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","无情驱逐"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/kr","숲의 추방"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","有敌人治疗携带“丛林印记”的敌人时，对其进行突击。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/kr","숲의 각인을 가진 적을 치료하는 적이 있을 때 해당 적에게 돌격한다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","携带“丛林印记”的敌人受到来自其他敌人的治疗时，卡夫拉跳跃至治疗来源附近对其发起攻击，造成250% ATK伤害，并使其在5秒内降低40点急速。过程中卡夫拉处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","숲의 각인을 가진 적이 다른 적의 치료를 받을 때 카프라가 치료자 근처로 점프 공격하여 250% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 5초 동안 급속을 40 감소시킨다. 이때 카프라는 제어 면역 상태가 된다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":45,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":79,"end":81,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":49,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":97,"end":102,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","施放本技能时，卡夫拉获得一个可以抵御350% ATK伤害的护盾，持续5秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","해당 스킬 시전 시 카프라가 대미지의 350% ATK를 막을 수 있는 실드 하나를 획득하며, 5초간 지속된다."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":21,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 260% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 270% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/kr","각성의 힘"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“林间追猎”首次释放时的伤害提升。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/kr","끊임없는 추격 첫 시전 시 대미지가 증가한다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每场战斗中，“林间追猎”首次释放时的伤害提升至520% ATK。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투마다 끊임없는 추격 첫 시전 시 대미지가 520% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":25,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","刚毅之挥"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/kr","기사도의 부름"]]}